What is the output of the following Java program examining static method hiding versus instance method overriding?
```java
class Worker {
    public static void identify() { System.out.print("W-Static "); }
    public void work() { System.out.print("W-Work "); }
}
class Specialist extends Worker {
    public static void identify() { System.out.print("S-Static "); }
    @Override
    public void work() { System.out.print("S-Work "); }
}
public class PolyDispatchApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Worker w = new Specialist();
        w.identify();
        w.work();
    }
}
```
